
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Local Business</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: #20332c;
  background: #f6f5f0;
}
header {
  background: #18392d;
  color: white;
  padding: 65px 24px;
  text-align: center;
}
h1 { font-size: 38px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
p { line-height: 1.7; }
section {
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 32px 24px;
}
.button {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #d9f27b;
  color: #18392d;
  padding: 15px 24px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.services {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));
  gap: 14px;
}
.service {
  background: white;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 10px;
}
footer {
  background: #18392d;
  color: white;
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>YOUR BUSINESS NAME</h1>
  <p>Reliable service. Excellent results.</p>
  <a class="button" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
</header>

<section>
  <h2>Welcome</h2>
  <p>
    We provide professional services to customers
    throughout your local area. Get in touch to
    discuss your needs and receive a free quote.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Our Services</h2>
  <div class="services">
    <div class="service">
      <h3>Service One</h3>
      <p>Describe your first service here.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <h3>Service Two</h3>
      <p>Describe your second service here.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service">
      <h3>Service Three</h3>
      <p>Describe your third service here.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>Ready to get started? Send us a message.</p>
  <a class="button"
     href="https://wa.me/447000000000">
    Message us on WhatsApp
  </a>
  <p>YOUR EMAIL ADDRESS</p>
</section>

<footer>
  © YOUR BUSINESS NAME
</footer>

</body>
</html>

